"[{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":32,\"ReplacementContent\":\"  - **Compact Typography & Spatial Hierarchy**: Optimized font sizes and padding across the cards to balance legibility with a highly compact layout (e.g. Badge value is `1.2rem` in an `84px` badge column, Card heading is `0.9375rem`, and tag pills are `0.68rem`). Sized down padding to `0.5rem` and gaps to `0.5rem` to keep the layout space-efficient.\",\"StartLine\":32,\"TargetContent\":\"  - **Enlarged Typography & Spatial Hierarchy**: Increased font sizes and padding across the cards to improve legibility and readability (e.g. Badge value is now `1.35rem`, Card heading is `0.9375rem`, and tag pills are `0.68rem`). Added a wider `100px` badge column and increased vertical margins to provide clean breathing room between card items.\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":44,\"ReplacementContent\":\"- **Scroll-Free Sidebar Layout**:\\n  - The left sidebar panel has its vertical scrollbar disabled (`overflow: hidden` on desktop/large screens) and has been vertically optimized by saving over `220px` of vertical height:\\n    - Sized down sidebar padding to `1.25rem 1.5rem` and gaps to `1.15rem`.\\n    - Sized down the profile avatar wrapper to `76px` x `76px` (from `96px`).\\n    - Sized down credentials card margins, gaps, and paddings.\\n    - Sized down the Focus Deck display body min-height to `125px` (from `200px`) to prevent wasted vertical whitespace.\\n    - This ensures the entire sidebar content fits comfortably and is 100% scroll-free on any screen height or notebook display resolution.\",\"StartLine\":43,\"TargetContent\":\"- **Scroll-Free Sidebar Layout**:\\n  - The left sidebar panel has its vertical scrollbar disabled (`overflow: hidden` on desktop/large screens) since the compact layout fits perfectly on modern viewports, eliminating the need to scroll.\"}]"